.Dd March 3, 2025
.Dt SIGMA-PKG 8
.Os SigmaOS
.Sh NAME
.Nm sigma-pkg
.Nd Sovereign universal package manager and content-addressed store client
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Fl -config Ar file
.Op Fl -y
.Op Ar package_name ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility is the primary package manager for
.Dx SigmaOS .
It provides universal package management across multi-distro formats
.Pq Pacman, APT, DNF, Portage, Nix, APK
using content-addressed store paths under
.Pa /sigma/store/
and Dilithium-5 post-quantum cryptographic signature validation.
.Pp
.Nm
executes package installations, upgrades, rollbacks, and sandboxed builds
inside FreeBSD poudriere-style clean chroot containers.
.Sh COMMANDS
The following primary commands are supported by
.Nm :
.Bl -tag -width "install"
.It Cm install Ar package
Download, verify, and install the specified
.Ar package
into the active system profile.
.It Cm remove Ar package
Remove
.Ar package
and clean up unreferenced store dependencies.
.It Cm update
Synchronize repository metadata mirrors and check for pending rolling upgrades.
.It Cm rollback
Atomically revert the active system profile to the previous generation state.
.It Cm build Ar pkgbuild
Compile a source build recipe inside a clean poudriere chroot container sandbox.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/etc/sigma/registry_config.json"
.It Pa /etc/sigma/registry_config.json
Package repository mirror configuration and public cryptographic keys.
.It Pa /sigma/store/
Content-addressed binary store directory.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr sigma-sh 1 ,
.Xr pkg 8 ,
.Xr pacman 8
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
utility was developed for the
.Dx SigmaOS
Sovereign Package Registry project.
